{"hw":"συμβαίνω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">συμβαίνω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">συμβαίνω</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">fut.</span> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <span class=\"gk\">-βήσομαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.3</span> </span>, etc.: <span class=\"lex-gram\">pf.</span> <span class=\"gk\">-βέβηκα</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">3</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">pl.</span> <span class=\"gk\">-βεβᾶσι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Hel.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">622</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Ion.</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">inf.</span> <span class=\"gk\">-βεβάναι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.146</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">pf.</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">inf.</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">-βεβάσθαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.98</span> </span>: <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor. 2</span> <span class=\"gk\">συνέβην</span> (v. infr.): <span class=\"lex-gram\">aor. 1</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\">subj.</span> <span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span> <span class=\"gk\">ξυμβαθῇ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.30</span> </span>:— <b class=\"lex-tr\">stand with the feet together</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hp.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Off.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">διαβαίνοντες μᾶλλον ἢ συμβεβηκότες</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\">