> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Hel.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">1007</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">4</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">attack jointly</b>, <span class=\"gk\">ἐπὶ Ναξίους</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Parth.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.1</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> most freq. metaph., <b class=\"lex-tr\">come to an agreement, come to terms</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">E.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ph.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">71</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">ἐπ' ἐλάττονι ς</span>. <b class=\"lex-tr\">agree</b> on (i.e. to accept) less, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">POxy.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">237 viii 11</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite-date\">(ii A.D.)</span>: c. dat., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.52</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.128</span> </span>, etc.; <span class=\"gk\">πρὸς ἀλλήλους</span> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">61</span> </span>, etc.: with neut. <span class=\"lex-gram\">Adj.</span>, <span class=\"gk\">ἐὰν ξυμβῶ τί σοι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ra.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">175</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἤν τι ξυμβαίνωσι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.5</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ξ. τὰ πλείω, οὐδέν</span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.117</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scop